    description `RHEL 9 must prevent a user from overriding the session idle-delay setting for the graphical user interface.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-271070,NIST-800-53:AC-11,NIST-800-53:AC-11(1)`
